==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Winterwing Butterfly}}
Winterwing Butterflies can be found flying in [[Hyrule Ridge]] and the [[Tabantha Frontier]]. In order to catch them, [[Link]] must be sneaking, or else they will fly away. Alternatively, they can be purchased from [[Beedle]] at the [[Gerudo Canyon Stable]] and [[Tabantha Bridge Stable]]. When combined with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]], the result will be a [[Chilly Elixir]] that grants [[Heat Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] as an ingredient to make Blue [[Dye]].

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Winterwing Butterfly}}
Winterwing Butterflies are blue-winged [[Butterfly|Butterflies]] with black bodies that can be found in [[Freezing Climate]]s on the [[Surface]] and in the [[Sky]]. [[Beedle]] also sells them at [[Tabantha Bridge Stable]]. They produce [[Chilly Elixir]]s when [[Cooking|Cooked]] with [[Monster Part]]s at a [[Cooking Pot]] or [[Portable Pot]].<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> They are known among [[Insect|Bug]] enthusiasts for the unique scales on their wings which cool the surrounding air.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Beedle"/> Winterwing Butterflies feed on dung and rotten [[Fruit]]s.<ref name="TotK Beedle 2"/>

